1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After his trial, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
After the Magic Knights awards ceremony, the grand finale of the Star Festival,

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
the nation's king delivered an announcement of monumental importance.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
We have located the Midnight Sun's hideout!

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
To combat this deadly fall, we're planning to gather the absolute cream of the crap from the Magic Knight Swords!

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
They'll be the Royal Knights!

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
And while Yuno and Osta were making sense of the news...

10
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Damn you! You wicked little imbecile!

11
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,000
They happen to run into the new captain of the Crimson Lion Kings, Meraleona Vermillion,

12
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
marating her squad members in a demonic rage.

13
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,000
The Magic Rage

14
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
The Magic Rage

15
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,000
The Magic Rage

16
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
The Magic Rage

17
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,000
The Magic Rage

18
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:33,520
May I have this 직업 next to yourца?

19
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:34,680
Boy, you don't seem to know what to do

20
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:38,480
I've just seen some beta Doctor where I was playing

21
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:43,780
It doesn't work with you

22
00:01:43,780 --> 00:01:48,780
確かなものを追い求めてさ

23
00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:53,780
どこへ行くの?

24
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:58,780
履き潰した靴のレッシュアート

25
00:01:58,780 --> 00:02:03,780
出発で一体どこだっけな

26
00:02:03,780 --> 00:02:06,780
いつかのページがひらくった

27
00:02:06,780 --> 00:02:09,780
言い訳ばかり探している

28
00:02:09,780 --> 00:02:12,780
毎日にさよなら

29
00:02:12,780 --> 00:02:14,780
助けるよ

30
00:02:14,780 --> 00:02:17,780
走り出す列車に乗り乗った

31
00:02:17,780 --> 00:02:19,780
小さくては見えないけど

32
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:22,780
大丈夫さ

33
00:02:22,780 --> 00:02:25,780
そんな気がするんだ

34
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:46,740
これを迎えあった

35
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:49,340
Frater Stultum is currently out of commission?!

36
00:02:49,340 --> 00:02:51,740
You feckless little invents!

37
00:02:51,740 --> 00:02:53,340
What's a Frater Stultum?

38
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,940
Idiot brother.

39
00:02:54,940 --> 00:02:57,040
Who is she talking about, though?

40
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:58,840
Foygolion, of course.

41
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:04,040
Wait a second! Are you trying to tell me that this crazy lady is related to Foygolion and Leo?!

42
00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:05,340
They're siblings?!

43
00:03:05,340 --> 00:03:08,140
That brother of mine has always been a buffoon!

44
00:03:08,140 --> 00:03:10,940
How could he have produced such a pack of cowards?!

45
00:03:10,940 --> 00:03:17,540
And now I have the pleasure of looking after you sad sex while he's off taking a nap!

46
00:03:17,540 --> 00:03:21,540
Foygolion's not fit to be your captain!

47
00:03:21,540 --> 00:03:23,140
Hold on, that's not true!

48
00:03:23,140 --> 00:03:26,440
My brother was the finest captain we ever could have asked for!

49
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:32,440
That's right! Captain Foygolion was a perfect example of the kind of person that every magic knight should aspire to be!

50
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:36,640
He cared about every member of this squad in the Clover Kingdom more than anyone else I've met in my life!

51
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:39,540
If you ask me, that man's the greatest magic knight in this whole country!

52
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:42,140
That's why I refuse to let you talk about him that way!

53
00:03:42,140 --> 00:03:43,140
Even if you are-

54
00:03:43,140 --> 00:03:48,140
Well, if you feel that strongly about it, then you'd better give me less talk and more action!

55
00:03:48,140 --> 00:03:54,140
Show me you're the strongest team in the kingdom, led by the strongest captain!

56
00:03:54,140 --> 00:03:56,340
That numbskull isn't going to die?!

57
00:03:56,340 --> 00:04:00,140
That would mean abandoning his country and the Crimson Lion Kings!

58
00:04:00,140 --> 00:04:10,740
So until he returns, I want every one of you to walk with pride and show the world the full glory of our mighty ranks!

59
00:04:10,740 --> 00:04:16,740
It's my job to work you to the bone while my brother's away, and that's exactly what I plan to do!

60
00:04:16,740 --> 00:04:19,340
Don't you dare let me down!

61
00:04:19,340 --> 00:04:20,340
Yes, ma'am!

62
00:04:20,340 --> 00:04:22,340
Did you hear that, Yuno?

63
00:04:22,340 --> 00:04:24,340
Man, she is on fire!

64
00:04:24,340 --> 00:04:25,340
Tell me about it.

65
00:04:25,340 --> 00:04:28,340
What kind of training is she going to make him do?

66
00:04:28,340 --> 00:04:31,340
Now then, off to the Hot Springs training camp.

67
00:04:31,340 --> 00:04:33,940
Hot Springs, seriously?

68
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:34,940
Hot Springs?

69
00:04:34,940 --> 00:04:35,940
Hot Springs, really?

70
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:36,940
Hot Springs, seriously?

71
00:04:36,940 --> 00:04:38,940
Hot Springs, really?

72
00:04:38,940 --> 00:04:39,940
Hot Springs, really?

73
00:04:39,940 --> 00:04:41,940
Whoa, that sounds like the funnest training camp in the world!

74
00:04:41,940 --> 00:04:42,940
And the easiest.

75
00:04:42,940 --> 00:04:43,940
I heard that.

76
00:04:43,940 --> 00:04:44,940
You're coming with us, kid.

77
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:45,940
How does that work?

78
00:04:45,940 --> 00:04:46,940
You trying to kidnap me?

79
00:04:46,940 --> 00:04:49,940
I mean, not that I wouldn't love to, but we're from different schools!

80
00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:52,940
You're coming with us, kid.

81
00:04:52,940 --> 00:04:53,940
How does that work?

82
00:04:53,940 --> 00:04:55,940
You trying to kidnap me?

83
00:04:55,940 --> 00:04:59,940
I mean, not that I wouldn't love to, but we're from different schools!

84
00:04:59,940 --> 00:05:03,940
I wouldn't love to, but we're from different squads, and it's dangerous to go places with strangers, so...

85
00:05:03,940 --> 00:05:04,940
Hey, Asta!

86
00:05:04,940 --> 00:05:07,940
Are you going to join our squad and be my official rival?

87
00:05:07,940 --> 00:05:08,940
No!

88
00:05:08,940 --> 00:05:09,940
I'm out.

89
00:05:09,940 --> 00:05:10,940
This doesn't involve me.

90
00:05:10,940 --> 00:05:11,940
Later.

91
00:05:11,940 --> 00:05:12,940
Yuno, wait!

92
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:13,940
Don't leave me!

93
00:05:13,940 --> 00:05:16,940
Both of you.

94
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:18,940
Uh-oh.

95
00:05:18,940 --> 00:05:21,940
Hey, cut it out, you big hothead!

96
00:05:21,940 --> 00:05:25,940
Yuno's not interested in your little spa trip, so get your hands off of that!

97
00:05:25,940 --> 00:05:28,940
It's not a spa trip!

98
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:29,940
Look, Belle.

99
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:31,940
I'd rather you stay out of this.

100
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:33,940
You'll only make her more heated.

101
00:05:33,940 --> 00:05:35,940
Kate, if you say so!

102
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:39,940
Once my sister sinks her claws into you, there's no hope of escaping.

103
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:41,940
She doesn't care for war.

104
00:05:41,940 --> 00:05:43,940
She's not interested in politics.

105
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:46,940
That's why she never really took center stage in our family.

106
00:05:46,940 --> 00:05:50,940
But when she does fight, she's arguably stronger than our brother.

107
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:54,940
They call her the uncrowned, undefeated lioness, Meryl Leona Vermillion!

108
00:05:54,940 --> 00:05:57,940
And I think I'll call you rookies one and two.

109
00:05:57,940 --> 00:06:00,940
Now let's hit the hot springs and see what you're made of.

110
00:06:00,940 --> 00:06:03,940
I don't know why, but I got a bad feeling about this!

111
00:06:03,940 --> 00:06:17,940
Whoa, that drink tasted like victory!

112
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:20,940
She feels good to outrank every magic knight in this whole bar!

113
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:22,940
Are you feeling okay, Char?

114
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:23,940
Call me Captain.

115
00:06:23,940 --> 00:06:24,940
Captain.

116
00:06:24,940 --> 00:06:25,940
You got it, Char.

117
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:30,940
Don't get all cocky just because you managed to win for once after a lifetime of bringing

118
00:06:30,940 --> 00:06:32,940
up the rear, sucky hero.

119
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:37,940
Must be rough for you getting your ass handed to you by the squad that always comes in dead

120
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:38,940
last!

121
00:06:38,940 --> 00:06:41,940
Shut your filthy mouth or I'll shut it for you!

122
00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:44,940
That's a pretty fancy hairdo you sporting there, Mr. Silver Eagles!

123
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:48,940
You must think very highly of yourself for a guy who got beat by the black bulls.

124
00:06:48,940 --> 00:06:49,940
Good for you!

125
00:06:49,940 --> 00:06:52,940
Oh, you wanna do this?

126
00:06:52,940 --> 00:06:54,940
Mercury magic!

127
00:06:54,940 --> 00:06:55,940
Silver spears!

128
00:06:57,940 --> 00:06:58,940
My apologies, sir.

129
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:01,940
We don't allow offensive spells in the bar.

130
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:04,940
Here's a drink on the house for the inconvenience.

131
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:06,940
Sorry, I wasn't aware.

132
00:07:10,940 --> 00:07:11,940
Delicious.

133
00:07:11,940 --> 00:07:13,940
The barkeep is right, Nozel.

134
00:07:13,940 --> 00:07:16,940
This is a place for enjoying drinks, not for fighting.

135
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:19,940
You shouldn't have missed the event.

136
00:07:19,940 --> 00:07:21,940
It was quite unbecoming.

137
00:07:21,940 --> 00:07:24,940
Your hairdo might be even stupider than his!

138
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:28,940
I'll make you eat those words, you ruffian!

139
00:07:28,940 --> 00:07:29,940
Nope.

140
00:07:29,940 --> 00:07:31,940
I'm sorry, sir.

141
00:07:31,940 --> 00:07:34,940
As I told the other gentleman, no offensive magic inside.

142
00:07:34,940 --> 00:07:36,940
Please accept a free drink.

143
00:07:36,940 --> 00:07:37,940
Oh, my goodness.

144
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:38,940
It must have slipped my mind.

145
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:39,940
Do forgive me.

146
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:42,940
And thank you for this.

147
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:46,940
Upon my word.

148
00:07:46,940 --> 00:07:49,940
Don't you clowns know how to stand up for yourselves?

149
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:51,940
Looks like it's my turn.

150
00:07:53,940 --> 00:07:54,940
Yeah.

151
00:07:54,940 --> 00:07:56,940
On second thought, I guess I could let it go.

152
00:07:56,940 --> 00:07:59,940
Why is everybody acting so damn reasonable now?

153
00:07:59,940 --> 00:08:03,940
Those bartenders gotta be putting some sketchy happy drugs in those cocktails of his.

154
00:08:04,940 --> 00:08:05,940
Captain Yami!

155
00:08:05,940 --> 00:08:07,940
I really look up to you.

156
00:08:07,940 --> 00:08:12,940
I mean, I only came in last place this one time and look how busted up I let myself get!

157
00:08:12,940 --> 00:08:15,940
But you were in dead last like forever and you never lost your cool.

158
00:08:15,940 --> 00:08:17,940
That's like superhuman or something.

159
00:08:17,940 --> 00:08:18,940
You really are amazing.

160
00:08:18,940 --> 00:08:23,940
You're so confident, so thick skinned, you don't care how much people laugh at you.

161
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:27,940
Even though you were always the worst, you did everything your way.

162
00:08:27,940 --> 00:08:28,940
Thank you.

163
00:08:32,940 --> 00:08:35,940
For the last time, I don't understand anything you're saying to me.

164
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:39,940
Cat, you just wait until next year.

165
00:08:40,940 --> 00:08:41,940
Oh, come on, you really leaving?

166
00:08:41,940 --> 00:08:42,940
What's wrong, Beanpole?

167
00:08:42,940 --> 00:08:45,940
Any other day you'd be begging me to go drink with you.

168
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:46,940
Shut it!

169
00:08:47,940 --> 00:08:48,940
Suit yourself.

170
00:08:48,940 --> 00:08:51,940
I guess that means I'll be knocking back the celebratory booze without you.

171
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:55,940
You sure are riding high for a one-time winner.

172
00:08:55,940 --> 00:08:56,940
Huh?

173
00:08:56,940 --> 00:08:57,940
Oh, Sisgolion.

174
00:08:57,940 --> 00:08:59,940
Where do you get that name from?

175
00:08:59,940 --> 00:09:02,940
You're Fwigolion's sister, so I assumed that was right.

176
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:07,940
You honestly believe a lineage as proud as mine would name their offspring so carelessly?

177
00:09:07,940 --> 00:09:08,940
You don't?

178
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:12,940
I figured you'd just take whatever thing you are and slap a Golion on the end of it.

179
00:09:13,940 --> 00:09:15,940
You're such a simpleton.

180
00:09:18,940 --> 00:09:20,940
Oh, hey, how's it going, Captain?

181
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:25,940
Looks like she got a hold of you, kid. How'd that happen anyway?

182
00:09:26,940 --> 00:09:28,940
Ah, that's kind of a long story.

183
00:09:29,940 --> 00:09:30,940
You're coming, too.

184
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:33,940
Being late's bad enough, but you didn't even show up.

185
00:09:34,940 --> 00:09:35,940
Hey, wait, wait, stop it.

186
00:09:36,940 --> 00:09:37,940
You need to learn a little discipline.

187
00:09:38,940 --> 00:09:40,940
Discipline? Well, I'm already the captain!

188
00:09:41,940 --> 00:09:43,940
Sorry, Yami, but it serves you right.

189
00:09:44,940 --> 00:09:45,940
You two!

190
00:09:45,940 --> 00:09:47,940
You're not taking my Char anywhere!

191
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:49,940
And who are you?

192
00:09:49,940 --> 00:09:50,940
Don't worry, Char.

193
00:09:50,940 --> 00:09:53,940
I may not know what's going on, but I'd follow you anywhere in the universe!

194
00:09:54,940 --> 00:09:56,940
For the last time, it's Captain.

195
00:09:57,940 --> 00:09:58,940
Asta, so this is where you've been hiding.

196
00:09:59,940 --> 00:10:01,940
Listen, it's not like you were the reason we came in second.

197
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:06,940
So dispense with the celebrating and help me give Kahono and Kyoto a proper send-off.

198
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:09,940
Oh, Mary Leona.

199
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:11,940
Oh, it's been too long.

200
00:10:11,940 --> 00:10:12,940
Well, have a nice night.

201
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:13,940
Uh-uh.

202
00:10:15,940 --> 00:10:16,940
Uh-uh.

203
00:10:17,940 --> 00:10:18,940
Noelle?

204
00:10:18,940 --> 00:10:19,940
Um, yes, ma'am?

205
00:10:19,940 --> 00:10:20,940
You're coming, too.

206
00:10:20,940 --> 00:10:21,940
Wait, wait a minute! You can't be serious!

207
00:10:21,940 --> 00:10:23,940
I don't have anything to do with this nonsense!

208
00:10:24,940 --> 00:10:27,940
Yeah, and how many fiery cat paws can this lady possibly have?!

209
00:10:27,940 --> 00:10:29,940
But why me? It's not fair.

210
00:10:29,940 --> 00:10:30,940
Don't be a baby!

211
00:10:31,940 --> 00:10:32,940
Do you have any idea where she's taking us?

212
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:34,940
A hot spring, I think?

213
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:36,940
A hot spring?

214
00:10:36,940 --> 00:10:43,940
Oh, hey there, Noelle. Could you wash my back for me?

215
00:10:44,940 --> 00:10:46,940
You're such a fervor!

216
00:10:46,940 --> 00:10:47,940
I him?!

217
00:10:48,940 --> 00:10:49,940
All of you, settle down!

218
00:10:49,940 --> 00:10:50,940
Uh-uh!

219
00:10:57,940 --> 00:10:59,940
Thank you for your patronage.

220
00:11:03,940 --> 00:11:04,940
Well, how do you like that?

221
00:11:05,940 --> 00:11:07,940
It looks like things are about to get more interesting.

222
00:11:19,940 --> 00:11:24,940
What the...? This is the hot spring?

223
00:11:25,940 --> 00:11:28,940
What's the hold-up?! Let's get to work!

224
00:11:28,940 --> 00:11:41,940
Yuletim Volcano is a strong magic region.

225
00:11:42,940 --> 00:11:47,940
Deep underground, there's a volcanic belt that's laced with mana and constantly spewing out lava.

226
00:11:50,940 --> 00:11:52,940
Normal humans can't set foot in this place.

227
00:11:52,940 --> 00:11:57,940
But if you reach the peak, you'll find the most fantastic and revitalizing hot spring you can imagine.

228
00:11:58,940 --> 00:11:59,940
How's that?!

229
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:01,940
Are you getting excited?!

230
00:12:02,940 --> 00:12:04,940
Come! Let's head for the summit!

231
00:12:05,940 --> 00:12:06,940
I wouldn't say excited!

232
00:12:07,940 --> 00:12:10,940
No way! This place is a nightmare!

233
00:12:11,940 --> 00:12:12,940
Then again...

234
00:12:12,940 --> 00:12:24,940
Sol, please wash my back.

235
00:12:25,940 --> 00:12:27,940
A hot spring with Char?! Sweet!

236
00:12:28,940 --> 00:12:31,940
Look, Sol, there was really no reason for you to tag along with us.

237
00:12:32,940 --> 00:12:35,940
What are you talking about?! I told you I'd follow you anywhere so this'll be easy as pie!

238
00:12:36,940 --> 00:12:37,940
Okay, Char?

239
00:12:37,940 --> 00:12:38,940
Call me Captain.

240
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:39,940
Roger, Char!

241
00:12:39,940 --> 00:12:43,940
I say we make it a race to see which one of us can get to the summit first! Are you game, Asuna?!

242
00:12:44,940 --> 00:12:45,940
Sure, I can stand to blow off some steam!

243
00:12:46,940 --> 00:12:47,940
I'm ready when you are!

244
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:48,940
Hey, Golden Boy!

245
00:12:48,940 --> 00:12:49,940
Are you in or what?

246
00:12:50,940 --> 00:12:51,940
Knock yourselves out.

247
00:12:52,940 --> 00:12:54,940
Oh right, he's Mr. Cool.

248
00:12:55,940 --> 00:12:56,940
Killjoy.

249
00:12:56,940 --> 00:12:57,940
Yeah, but you get used to it.

250
00:12:58,940 --> 00:13:00,940
Quick wasting time and let's go!

251
00:13:00,940 --> 00:13:08,940
Alright, time to do this!

252
00:13:08,940 --> 00:13:09,940
Poor magic to do the trick!

253
00:13:13,940 --> 00:13:15,940
What's the deal with this heat?

254
00:13:16,940 --> 00:13:18,940
The mana in the atmosphere is going crazy!

255
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:20,940
I'm suffocating!

256
00:13:20,940 --> 00:13:21,940
It's hard to breathe!

257
00:13:21,940 --> 00:13:27,940
I feel like my chest is on fire and my sweat glands are about to explode!

